हिलो पेपरले पाँच परिवारमा गति र शुद्धता नाप्छ: भूगोल, इतिहास-राजनीति र अर्थतन्त्र, विज्ञान-प्रविधि, मानसिक क्षमता, र भाषा। सही उत्तरमा एक अङ्क, गलतमा त्यसको पाँचौं भाग घट्छ — त्यसैले अनुमान तालिम लिनुपर्ने सीप हो, बानी होइन।"},"strategy":{"en":"Answer in three passes: certain first, probable second, blank last. With 20% negative marking, leaving a question empty is often the better bet than a coin flip.","ne":"तीन चरणमा उत्तर दिनुहोस्: पक्का पहिले, सम्भावित दोस्रो, खाली अन्त्यमा। २०% नकारात्मक अङ्कमा, प्रश्न खाली छोड्नु धाक्का भन्दा धेरैजसो राम्रो हुन्छ।"},"subjects":[{"slug":"geography","title":{"en":"Geography of Nepal and the world","ne":"नेपाल र विश्वको भूगोल"},"units":[{"slug":"physical","title":{"en":"Physical set-up","ne":"भौतिक संरचना"},"points":["Himal, Pahad, Terai and the internal rivers","River systems: Koshi, Gandaki, Karnali, Mahanadi","Climate zones and their effect on settlement"]},{"slug":"human","title":{"en":"Population and settlement","ne":"जनसंख्या र बस्ती"},"points":["Census reading, density and migration","Urban and rural settlement patterns","Road, air and river connectivity"]},{"slug":"resources","title":{"en":"Resources and economy of place","ne":"स्रोत र स्थानको अर्थतन्त्र"},"points":["Water, forest, mineral and hydropower potential","Agriculture zones and food security","Disaster geography: flood, landslide, earthquake"]},{"slug":"world","title":{"en":"World geography basics","ne":"विश्व भूगोलको आधार"},"points":["Continents, oceans and major straits","Climate and vegetation belts","Nepal's position in South Asia and its neighbours"]}]},{"slug":"polity","title":{"en":"History, polity and economy","ne":"इतिहास, राजनीति र अर्थतन्त्र"},"units":[{"slug":"history","title":{"en":"Nepal's modern history","ne":"नेपालको आधुनिक इतिहास"},"points":["Unification and its administration","Rana period and the 2006 change","Peace process and the constitution"]},{"slug":"constitution","title":{"en":"Constitution as polity","ne":"राजनीतिको आधार संविधान"},"points":["Structure of the 2072 constitution","Fundamental rights and duties","Distribution of power: federation, province, local"]},{"slug":"economy","title":{"en":"Economy in one page","ne":"एक पृष्ठको अर्थतन्त्र"},"points":["Three sectors and their share of work","Remittance, trade balance and foreign currency","Budget language: revenue, capital, grant"]},{"slug":"institutions","title":{"en":"State institutions","ne":"राज्यका निकाय"},"points":["Executive, legislature, judiciary","Constitutional bodies and their mandate","Independent offices and accountability"]}]},{"slug":"sciencetech","title":{"en":"Science and technology","ne":"विज्ञान र प्रविधि"},"units":[{"slug":"everyday","title":{"en":"Everyday science","ne":"दैनिक विज्ञान"},"points":["Health, agriculture and environment basics","Disaster science for Nepal","Energy: hydro, solar, and the grid"]},{"slug":"digital","title":{"en":"Digital governance","ne":"डिजिटल सुशासन"},"points":["E-governance services and their legal base","Data protection and the privacy law","Cyber security awareness for officers"]},{"slug":"current","title":{"en":"Technology in the news","ne":"समाचारको प्रविधि"},"points":["Artificial intelligence in public work","Space, satellites and weather services","What a new technology changes for a citizen"]}]},{"slug":"aptitude-reasoning","title":{"en":"Mental ability, IQ and reasoning","ne":"मानसिक क्षमता, IQ र तर्क"},"units":[{"slug":"verbal","title":{"en":"Verbal reasoning","ne":"शाब्दिक तर्क"},"points":["Analogy, classification, series","Coding-decoding","Statement, assumption and conclusion"]},{"slug":"quant","title":{"en":"Quantitative aptitude","ne":"गाणितिक क्षमता"},"points":["Percentage, profit-loss, interest","Time-work, time-distance","Averages, ratio and proportion"]},{"slug":"data","title":{"en":"Data interpretation","ne":"तथ्याङ्क व्याख्या"},"points":["Table, bar and pie reading","Sets and Venn diagrams","Speed: what to calculate and what to estimate"]},{"slug":"puzzle","title":{"en":"Puzzles and seating","ne":"पजल र बसाइ"},"points":["Sequence and arrangement","Blood relations","Clock, calendar and direction"]}]},{"slug":"language","title":{"en":"Language: English and Nepali","ne":"भाषा: अङ्ग्रेजी र नेपाली"},"units":[{"slug":"english","title":{"en":"English for official work","ne":"कार्यालयको अङ्ग्रेजी"},"points":["Grammar in use: tense, agreement, preposition","Vocabulary that appears in papers","Precis, letter and report writing"]},{"slug":"nepali","title":{"en":"Nepali language and practical writing","ne":"नेपाली भाषा र व्यावहारिक लेखन"},"points":["शुद्ध लेखन, विराम चिह्न","कार्यपत्र, निवेदन, टिप्पणी शैली","सारांश र भावार्थ"]},{"slug":"translation","title":{"en":"Translation between the two","ne":"दुई भाषाको अनुवाद"},"points":["Official terms and their pairs","Number, date and name conventions","Reading a law in one language, writing in the other"]}]}]},{"slug":"governance","color":"var(--vi)","title":{"en":"Governance System","ne":"सुशासन प्रणाली"},"short":{"en":"Written · 100 marks","ne":"लिखित · १०० अङ्क"},"intro":{"en":"The written governance paper asks how the state actually runs: the constitution as the source of power, the machinery of public service, and how the country's resources are governed. Answers that quote the right section and name the right body score; answers that stay general do not.","ne":"सुशासनको लिखित पेपरले राज्य वास्तवमा कसरी चल्छ भन्ध सोध्छ: सत्ताको स्रोत संविधान, जनसेवाको यन्त्र, र देशको स्रोत कसरी सुशासित हुन्छ भन्ने। सही दफा उद्धृत र सही निकायको नाम लेखेको उत्तरले अङ्क पाउँछ; सामान्य उत्तरले पाउँदैन।"},"strategy":{"en":"For every unit keep three lines ready: the law that creates it, the body that runs it, and one real example of it working or failing.","ne":"हरेक एकाइका लागि तीन लाइन तयार राख्नुहोस्: त्यसलाई सिर्जना गर्ने कानून, चलाउने निकाय, र चलिरहेको वा असफल भएको एक वास्तविक उदाहरण।"},"subjects":[{"slug":"state","title":{"en":"The state and its structure","ne":"राज्य र यसको संरचना"},"units":[{"slug":"sovereignty","title":{"en":"State, sovereignty, citizenship","ne":"राज्य, सार्वभौमसत्ता, नागरिकता"},"points":["Elements of a state","Citizenship law and its amendments","Federal, provincial and local sovereignty"]},{"slug":"three-organs","title":{"en":"Legislature, executive, judiciary","ne":"ब्यवस्थापिका, कार्यपालिका, न्यायपालिका"},"points":["Composition and power at three levels","Checks and balance in practice","Case law an officer should know"]},{"slug":"local","title":{"en":"Local governance","ne":"स्थानीय तहको सुशासन"},"points":["Local Government Operation Act in outline","Services delegated to a municipality","Planning and budget at the local level"]}]},{"slug":"constitution-law","title":{"en":"Constitution and essential laws","ne":"संविधान र आवश्यक कानून"},"units":[{"slug":"constitution","title":{"en":"Constitution of Nepal 2072","ne":"नेपालको संविधान २०७२"},"points":["Preamble, parts and schedules","Fundamental rights and their remedy","Directive principles and state responsibility"]},{"slug":"civil-service-law","title":{"en":"Civil service law","ne":"नागरिक सेवा कानून"},"points":["Civil Service Act 2049 and Rules 2064","Class, category and the schedule of posts","Discipline, inquiry and appeal"]},{"slug":"commissions","title":{"en":"Commission and accountability bodies","ne":"आयोग र जवाफदेही निकाय"},"points":["Public Service Commission Act 2049","Anti-corruption law and its reach","Audit, human rights and information commissions"]},{"slug":"rti","title":{"en":"Right to information and privacy","ne":"सूचना अधिकार र गोपनीयता"},"points":["RTI Act 2064: what to give, what to refuse","Privacy law and citizen data","Record keeping and disclosure duty"]}]},{"slug":"public-service","title":{"en":"Public service and administration","ne":"जनसेवा र प्रशासन"},"units":[{"slug":"machinery","title":{"en":"Machinery of government","ne":"सरकारी यन्त्र"},"points":["Secretariat, department, attached office","Role of a section officer","Delegation and file movement"]},{"slug":"process","title":{"en":"Departmental process","ne":"विभागीय प्रक्रिया"},"points":["Departmental Process Act 2064","Noting, drafting and order writing","Time limits and follow-up"]},{"slug":"service-delivery","title":{"en":"Service delivery and citizen charter","ne":"सेवा प्रवाह र नागरिक बडापत्र"},"points":["Public service standards","Grievance handling","Measurement: what good looks like"]},{"slug":"ethics","title":{"en":"Ethics and integrity","ne":"नैतिकता र इमानदारी"},"points":["Conflict of interest","Code of conduct for civil servants","Whistle-blowing and protection"]}]},{"slug":"resources-governance","title":{"en":"Resources and their governance","ne":"स्रोत र त्यसको सुशासन"},"units":[{"slug":"natural","title":{"en":"Natural resources","ne":"प्राकृतिक स्रोत"},"points":["Water, forest, land and mineral law","Hydropower and licensing","Community and state sharing"]},{"slug":"environment","title":{"en":"Environment and climate","ne":"वातावरण र जलवायु"},"points":["Environment Act and IEE/EIA","Disaster law and preparedness","Climate finance an officer must read"]},{"slug":"finance","title":{"en":"Public finance","ne":"सार्वजनिक वित्त"},"points":["Appropriation, budget and audit cycle","Revenue: Income Tax Act 2058 in outline","Fiscal federalism and the transfer formula"]}]}]},{"slug":"contemporary","color":"var(--mg)","title":{"en":"Contemporary Issues","ne":"समकालीन मुद्दा"},"short":{"en":"Written · 100 marks","ne":"लिखित · १०० अङ्क"},"intro":{"en":"This paper rewards a candidate who can describe a Nepali problem precisely, then say what the state can realistically do about it. Four families carry almost every question: society, economy, development, and environment.","ne":"यो पेपरले नेपालको समस्या स्पष्टसँग वर्णन गरी, राज्यले वास्तविक रूपमा के गर्न सक्छ भन्न सक्नेलाई पुरस्कार दिन्छ। चार परिवारले लगभग हरेक प्रश्न बोक्छन्: समाज, अर्थतन्त्र, विकास, र वातावरण।"},"strategy":{"en":"Build a one-page card per issue: what it is, two numbers that prove it, who owns it, what has been tried, what you would do in the first ninety days.","ne":"हरेक मुद्दाको एक पृष्ठको कार्ड बनाउनुहोस्: के हो, प्रमाणित दुई अङ्क, कसको जिम्मा, के गरियो, र पहिलो नब्बे दिनमा तपाईंले के गर्थ्यौं।"},"subjects":[{"slug":"social","title":{"en":"Social issues","ne":"सामाजिक मुद्दा"},"units":[{"slug":"inclusion","title":{"en":"Inclusion and identity","ne":"समावेशीकरण र पहिचान"},"points":["Reservation and its legal basis","Language, ethnicity and the state","Gender policy in practice"]},{"slug":"migration","title":{"en":"Migration and remittance","ne":"पलायन र विप्रेषण"},"points":["Foreign employment law","Remittance and the local economy","Brain drain and what reverses it"]},{"slug":"health-edu","title":{"en":"Health and education","ne":"स्वास्थ्य र शिक्षा"},"points":["Access, quality and cost","Federal split of services","Digital divide in classrooms"]}]},{"slug":"economic","title":{"en":"Economic issues","ne":"आर्थिक मुद्दा"},"units":[{"slug":"macro","title":{"en":"Macro picture","ne":"समष्टि चित्र"},"points":["Growth, inflation and the rupee","Trade deficit and imports","Employment and the informal economy"]},{"slug":"industry","title":{"en":"Industry, agriculture, tourism","ne":"उद्योग, कृषि, पर्यटन"},"points":["Why industry stalled and what restarts it","Agriculture value chain","Tourism as foreign exchange"]},{"slug":"private","title":{"en":"Public-private interface","ne":"सार्वजनिक-निजी साझेदारी"},"points":["PPPs and their law","Ease of doing business","Procurement rules and integrity"]}]},{"slug":"development","title":{"en":"Development and governance","ne":"विकास र सुशासन"},"units":[{"slug":"planning","title":{"en":"Planning in Nepal","ne":"नेपालको योजना"},"points":["Periodic plans and the current one","Project cycle and appraisal","Monitoring and evaluation"]},{"slug":"aid","title":{"en":"Aid, debt and delivery","ne":"सहायता, ऋण र कार्यान्वयन"},"points":["Grant versus loan discipline","Absorption capacity","Mega projects and their review"]},{"slug":"sdg","title":{"en":"Global commitments at home","ne":"घरमा विश्व प्रतिबद्धता"},"points":["SDGs mapped to Nepali targets","LDC graduation and what changes","Disaster frameworks"]}]},{"slug":"environment","title":{"en":"Environment and climate","ne":"वातावरण र जलवायु"},"units":[{"slug":"himalaya","title":{"en":"Mountains, water and glaciers","ne":"हिमाल, पानी र हिमनदी"},"points":["Glacier retreat and lakes","River basins downstream","Hydropower and sediment"]},{"slug":"disaster","title":{"en":"Disaster and adaptation","ne":"प्रकोप र अनुकूलन"},"points":["Flood, landslide, earthquake risk","Early warning and response","Adaptation finance"]},{"slug":"urban","title":{"en":"Cities, pollution, transport","ne":"सहर, प्रदूषण, यातायात"},"points":["Air quality in the valley","Public transport and land use","Waste and water in growing towns"]}]}]},{"slug":"service","color":"var(--gold)","title":{"en":"Service Subject","ne":"सेवा विषय"},"short":{"en":"Written · 100 marks","ne":"लिखित · १०० अङ्क"},"intro":{"en":"For the general Section Officer post the service subject is the trade of the job: management, revenue, accounting, auditing and how federalism divides the work. This is where a candidate becomes an officer on paper.","ne":"सामान्य शाखा अधिकृत पदका लागि सेवा विषय भनेको कामको सीप हो: व्यवस्थापन, राजस्व, लेखा, लेखा परीक्षण र संघीयताले काम कसरी बाँड्छ। यहीँ उम्मेदवार कागजमा अधिकारी बन्छ।"},"strategy":{"en":"Learn each topic as a workflow, not a definition: who applies, what document moves, what the law requires, what the deadline is, what goes wrong.","ne":"हरेक विषय परिभाषा होइन कार्यप्रवाहको रूपमा सिक्नुहोस्: कसले लगाउँछ, कुन कागज चल्छ, कानूनले के माग्छ, म्याद के हो, के बिग्रन्छ।"},"subjects":[{"slug":"management","title":{"en":"Management","ne":"व्यवस्थापन"},"units":[{"slug":"functions","title":{"en":"Planning, organising, leading, controlling","ne":"योजना, संर्गठन, नेतृत्व, नियन्त्रण"},"points":["Each function in an office setting","Delegation and span of control","Control systems and reporting"]},{"slug":"hr","title":{"en":"Human resource management","ne":"मानव स्रोत व्यवस्थापन"},"points":["Recruitment through the Commission","Training, transfer, promotion","Performance agreement and appraisal"]},{"slug":"og","title":{"en":"Organisational behaviour","ne":"संगठनात्मक व्यवहार"},"points":["Motivation and its theories in use","Groups, conflict and negotiation","Change management in government"]},{"slug":"pm","title":{"en":"Project and office management","ne":"परियोजना र कार्यालय व्यवस्थापन"},"points":["Logframe, schedule, risk","Records and file management","Meeting, minute and follow-through"]}]},{"slug":"revenue","title":{"en":"Revenue and taxation","ne":"राजस्व र कर"},"units":[{"slug":"system","title":{"en":"The revenue system","ne":"राजस्व प्रणाली"},"points":["Federal, provincial and local revenue","Income Tax Act 2058 in outline","VAT and excise basics"]},{"slug":"admin","title":{"en":"Tax administration","ne":"कर प्रशासन"},"points":["Registration, return, assessment","Recovery and penalty","Taxpayer service and dispute"]},{"slug":"customs","title":{"en":"Customs and trade","ne":"भन्डार र व्यापार"},"points":["Import-export procedure","Valuation and classification","Border points and Nepal's trade"]}]},{"slug":"accounting","title":{"en":"Accounting and auditing","ne":"लेखा र लेखा परीक्षण"},"units":[{"slug":"govt-accounting","title":{"en":"Government accounting","ne":"सरकारी लेखा"},"points":["Budget to expenditure chain","Chart of accounts and classification","Month and year closing"]},{"slug":"audit","title":{"en":"Audit types","ne":"लेखा परीक्षणका प्रकार"},"points":["Compliance, performance, financial","Internal audit in a line agency","Audit report and follow-up"]},{"slug":"controls","title":{"en":"Financial control","ne":"वित्तीय नियन्त्रण"},"points":["Delegation of financial power","Procurement thresholds","Irregularity, recovery and accountability"]}]},{"slug":"federalism","title":{"en":"Federalism in practice","ne":"व्यवहारमा संघीयता"},"units":[{"slug":"division","title":{"en":"Division of power","ne":"क्षमता बाँडफाँड"},"points":["Schedules of exclusive and concurrent power","Concurrent legislation in practice","Subsidiarity and local autonomy"]},{"slug":"fiscal","title":{"en":"Fiscal federalism","ne":"वित्तीय संघीयता"},"points":["Revenue sharing and grants","The fiscal commission formula","Provincial and local budgets"]},{"slug":"coordination","title":{"en":"Coordination and dispute","ne":"समन्वय र विवाद"},"points":["Inter-council machinery","Office of the President and CM roles","Judicial route for disputes"]}]}]}],"allMarks":480}]]}],"$L21"],null,"$L22"]}]
